            {
              "id": "b000031",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The Faculty of Business Studies and Finance was established in 1999 as an academic faculty of Wayamba University of Sri Lanka. It was established by the Government Notification in the Extraordinary Gazette No. 1093/8 of Tuesday, 17 August 1999, and commenced operations on 01 October 1999.</p>",
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 15
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "b000032",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The faculty offers a range of undergraduate, postgraduate, diploma and external programmes across four academic departments: Accountancy, Banking & Finance, Business Management, and Insurance & Valuation.</p>",
                "alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_text_color": "#2b2f36",
                "_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 15
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
